      "cooked": "<p>I intend to back (at least) the PDF version of the project, but I had&nbsp;2&nbsp;Kickstarter-related&nbsp;questions:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.&nbsp; In other Kickstarters, you can pledge $1 or so and you're able to buy just Add-on's (in this case, the History of Sentinel Comics book).&nbsp; Will this backing option&nbsp;be a feature of this Kickstarter?</p>\n<p>2.&nbsp; Does anyone know whether or not there will be&nbsp;a PDF version of the History of Sentinel Comics book available&nbsp;as an add-on?</p>\n<p>Thanks for all the input!</p>",
